        "body": "# Composite workbench\nA **Composite** is a computing subgraph behind one typed card. Right-click a card (or its **Edit contents** button) to drill in: rewire, add nodes, add **+ Input / + Output** boundary ports, or **Unpack** it back onto the canvas. Select nodes and press **Ctrl+Shift+G** to make your own.",
