        "body": "# The same loop, unboxed\nThese two cards feed each other OUTSIDE a Simulate container, so the pass dead-ends them with **#CIRC!** instead of recursing — and everything downstream shows the propagated error. Collapse them into a composite (Ctrl+Shift+G) and switch it to Simulation to resolve the loop.",
