      "x": -40,
      "y": 1260,
      "init": {
        "label": "Goal seek — solve backwards",
        "body": "# Goal-seek mode\nThis composite computes **profit = units × $25 margin − $500 fixed**. The container is in **Goal seek** mode: it drives the **Units** input until **Profit** hits the target (0 = break-even) and shows the solved value (20). Excel's Goal Seek, as a run mode.",
        "color": "teal",
        "width": 430,
        "height": 180
      }
    },
